@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra API chay -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nop bai hop le -> 201 Created
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "dtc245201006",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/minesan2297/EduSubmit-dtc245201006"
}

### 4. Nop bai thieu thong tin -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 5. Doc luot nop hop le -> 200 OK (Bước 12)
# Chu y: Thay ma Guid bang Id nhan duoc tu request so 3
@submissionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}

### 6. Doc luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found (Bước 12)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

